\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span> (topological carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span> (topologies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq X\">\\(C\\subseteq X\\)</span> (closed-set candidate bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\)</span> (canonical closed-map predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"484e951b19c4c192\" href=\"?note=484e951b19c4c192\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map\">58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ClosedMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ClosedMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}closed\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}closed\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact alias of the typed closed-map predicate, including its function graph and relation-image witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map","status":"resolved","id":"484e951b19c4c192","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-image","status":"resolved","id":"c189b9b31702b9de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map","status":"resolved","id":"484e951b19c4c192","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S$ (canonical closed-map predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S","display":false},{"te